  "body_html": "<p>Elevate any bedroom with this personalized Baseball Comforter Set from Jeminise, designed for sports enthusiasts. Crafted for comfort and style, this bedding set allows for custom touches, making it a unique addition to your home decor or a thoughtful gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process to hold dye and prevent fading, ensuring long-lasting vibrancy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel, with whole-piece microfiber filling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, maintaining its fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize with custom name text inputs to create a truly unique bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Breathable Design:</strong> Engineered with breathable properties for comfortable use across all seasons.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
